OL,3,CNine-year-old tells court his 'heart
OL,4,Cfeels so empty' after father's death
OL,6,FA nine-year-old boy has spoken of the
OL,7,Fdevastating loss of his father,
OL,8,Ftelling a court he will never get to
OL,9,Fsee him again.
OL,11,FBusinessman Gary Mouat, 37, was found
OL,12,Fdead at his home in Banbury in
OL,13,FOxfordshire, in July last year after
OL,14,Fbeing drugged with a sedative gamma-
OL,15,Fbutyrolactone (GBL).
OL,17,FThe married father-of-one was killed
OL,18,Fby Adina Mihai, 31, who was posing as
OL,19,Fa sex worker, and her partner Madalin
OL,20,FDumitru, 30.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
