OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786801685
OL,3,CNine-year-old tells court his 'heart
OL,4,Cfeels so empty' after father's death
OL,6,FToday the pair were jailed for a total
OL,7,Fof 34 years in prison.
OL,9,FThey would arrange to meet men paying
OL,10,Ffor sex at their homes and would drug
OL,11,Fthem unconscious to steal from them,
OL,12,FOxford Crown Court heard.
OL,14,FIn a victim impact statement, which
OL,15,Fwas recorded and played to the court,
OL,16,Fhis son said the defendants had ruined
OL,17,Fhis life.
OL,19,F"My dad was funny, silly, loving and a
OL,20,Ftrickster, we always used to prank
OL,21,Feach other," the nine-year-old said.
OL,26,@{D@AOU}D@LO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
