CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786801685
OL,3,CNine-year-old tells court his 'heart
OL,4,Cfeels so empty' after father's death
OL,6,F"Why did you have to kill my dad, you
OL,7,Fcould have just taken the money, he
OL,8,Fwas really kind, he would have given
OL,9,Fit to you.
OL,11,F"He was my dad and now he's gone.
OL,13,F"Ever since my dad died my life has
OL,14,Fbeen really tough. I miss him every
OL,15,Fday and will never get to see him
OL,16,Fagain.
OL,18,F"I will never be able to get another
OL,19,Fdad and that makes me feel so sad.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUuD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
