PN,38904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786801685
OL,3,CNine-year-old tells court his 'heart
OL,4,Cfeels so empty' after father's death
OL,6,F"You have ruined my life and all the
OL,7,Fplans we had to do things together. My
OL,8,Ffamily is destroyed now.
OL,10,F"I will never be able to go and watch
OL,11,Fa football game with my dad now. I
OL,12,Fwon't get to go have my first beer
OL,13,Fwith him. I don't know what my life
OL,14,Fwill be like now, I always imagined my
OL,15,Fdad would be here.
OL,17,F"My heart feels so empty, sometimes it
OL,18,Fhurts so much I feel like I have to
OL,19,Freboot it. I feel sad every day and
OL,20,Fmiss him all the time.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
