PN,38905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786801685
OL,3,CNine-year-old tells court his 'heart
OL,4,Cfeels so empty' after father's death
OL,6,F"I hope you realise how many hearts
OL,7,Fhave been broken because of what you
OL,8,Fdid.
OL,10,F"After it happened I was so scared
OL,11,Fthat something would happen to my mum,
OL,12,FI didn't want to let her out my sight.
OL,14,F"I couldn't sleep because I kept
OL,15,Fhaving nightmares that something bad
OL,16,Fhappened to her too. I still have
OL,17,Fthese now sometimes.
OL,19,F"I get scared someone will come to my
OL,20,Fhouse and hurt her too. Sometimes I
OL,21,Fdon't feel safe.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUvD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
