OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786801685
OL,3,CNine-year-old tells court his 'heart
OL,4,Cfeels so empty' after father's death
OL,6,F"I used to wake up in the night and
OL,7,Fthink that my dad was still here and
OL,8,Fthen realise he wasn't.
OL,10,F"I will never get over my dad being
OL,11,Fkilled, I will never forget him and I
OL,12,Fwill miss him for the rest of my life.
OL,13,FI hope I make him proud."
OL,15,FMembers of the Mouat family comforted
OL,16,Feach other in court and shed tears as
OL,17,Fthey watched him deliver his statement.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUuD@YO]
